{"version":1,"content":"<p>墨西哥城慶祝亡靈節，一座33.4米高、約11層樓高的「Catrina」女骷髏像，打破最高同類雕像的健力士世界紀錄，較2023年創下的28.15米紀錄高5米。</p><p>雕像由約140名藝術家及技術人員製作，片段可見女骷髏身穿逾27米長紫裙，四周鋪滿萬壽菊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:20:29.741611+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:49:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T21:38:16.717267+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:17:59.650669+00:00","content_hash":"e3332cf7b8795ce07c21a98a35317ebb168c378e3df91541bc13abf1497503a8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}